      "type": "text",
      "text": "Before txing w drugs or pacing, consider reversible causes: meds (beta-blockers, calcium channel blockers, digoxin, antiarrhythmics), hypoxia, hyperkalemia, hypothyroidism, ↑  vagal tone, myocardial ischemia/infarction, hypothermia, inferior MI (vagal activation from RCA occlusion), elevated ICP."
     }
